flowchart TB
    U[User: text or voice]:::userStyle --> G[Conversation Gateway<br/>auth, consent, normalization]:::ioStyle
    G --> P[Perception and Appraisal<br/>intent, entities, time, affect, safety]:::controlStyle
    P --> CUE[Hippocampal-inspired Cue Encoder<br/>novelty and pattern separation]:::hippoStyle

    CUE --> WM[(Active Workspace<br/>recent turns, focus, goals)]:::fastStyle
    CUE --> EP[(Episodic Ledger<br/>events and evidence)]:::memoryStyle
    CUE --> SM[(Semantic Beliefs<br/>facts and temporal versions)]:::memoryStyle
    CUE --> RM[(Relationship Model<br/>per user and agent)]:::affectStyle
    CUE --> MAP[(Cognitive Map<br/>typed associations)]:::mapStyle

    WM --> R[Pattern Completion and Reranking<br/>hybrid search, conflicts, diversity]:::hippoStyle
    EP --> R
    SM --> R
    RM --> R
    MAP --> R

    ID[(Protected Self-Schema<br/>identity, values, boundaries)]:::stableStyle --> X[Executive Context Allocator<br/>relevance, privacy, token budget]:::controlStyle
    AF[(Affective State<br/>bounded, decaying signals)]:::affectStyle --> X
    PROC[(Procedural Policy<br/>skills, voice, routines)]:::stableStyle --> X
    R --> X
    WM --> X

    X --> L[Replaceable LLM<br/>reasoning and language]:::modelStyle
    L --> V[Prediction and Consistency Critic<br/>safety, grounding, identity, style]:::controlStyle
    V --> OUT[Unified Reply]:::ioStyle
    OUT --> U

    V --> J[Post-turn Encoder<br/>evidence extraction and idempotent write]:::hippoStyle
    J --> WM
    J --> EP
    J --> AF
    J --> RM
    J --> Q[[Consolidation Queue]]:::offlineStyle
    Q --> K[Offline Replay and Consolidation<br/>cluster, abstract, deduplicate, decay]:::offlineStyle
    K --> SM
    K --> MAP
    K --> EP

    classDef userStyle fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0284c7,color:#082f49;
    classDef ioStyle fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#052e16;
